<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Adecco SA.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Adecco SA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued four million American-style call warrants, on Adecco SA bearer shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. Bank said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    450 CHF		   PREMIUM	17.14 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.20 CHF		  GEARING	10.0 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.FEB.97-20.FEB.98   PAYDATE	24.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  420 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
